@startuml
actor Human
participant CLI
participant "HumanVerifier / Windows login" as Verify
participant "Existing DesignDecision authority" as Approval
database SQLite
CLI -> Human : exact action, artifacts, policy and evidence
Human -> CLI : approve request with justification
CLI -> Verify : confirm request digest and authenticate
Verify --> Approval : verified canonical SID
Approval -> SQLite : BEGIN IMMEDIATE
Approval -> Approval : recheck artifacts, expiry and allowed identity
Approval -> SQLite : append decision and audit
SQLite --> CLI : committed decision
CLI --> Human : approval record ID
@enduml
